id: full-repair
name: Full Repair
prerequisite: 2+ Skill Ranks in Craft
requiresSkill: craft
requiresRanks: 2
sessionLimit: 1
timeCost: 2~10 Hours
# How long, asked when it is used: any hour from 2 to 10.
hoursMin: 2
hoursMax: 10
# "Regains Life ... equal to 1/5 of their respective maximums for every 2 hours spent."
fullRepair: true
repairShare: 5
repairHours: 2
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Two to ten hours on a Vehicle, a Battle Jacket or a Weapon: a fifth of its Life Points back - and a
  Battle Jacket's Ki Points - for every 2 hours.
text: >
  Full Repair: You painstakingly repair damage to your vehicle, replacing damaged parts and ensuring
  full funtionality.
  –Prerequisite: 2+ Skill Ranks in Craft
  –Session Limit: 1
  –Time Cost: 2~10 Hours
  –Effect: Select a Vehicle or Battle Jacket. It regains Life and (for the Battle Jacket) Ki Points
  equal to 1/5 of their respective maximums for every 2 hours spent on the Full Repair Maneuver.

---

# Offered on the Adventure tab to whoever has 2+ Ranks in Craft - and it is what a Weapon's Repair on
# the Gear tab does: "To repair a Weapon, use the Full Repair Adventuring Maneuver" (the user's ruling:
# Weapons too). Asked: which - one of their Weapons, or a Vehicle or Battle Jacket - and how many
# hours, 2 to 10; every full 2 is a fifth (5 hours is two fifths). The use counts at once; the card's
# button, once the hours are spent, gives the Weapon its Life Points back (a destroyed one comes back).
# Vehicles and Battle Jackets are not built: for those the card says what they regain.
